fixture hazard_respawn_drops_stale_jump
doc docs/adr/0010, hazards (movement review 4, M2): a jump pressed over the spikes on frame 58, the air jump already spent, three ticks before the hazard. The send-back uses up every press still buffered, so nothing pressed over the pit fires at the respawn point: no jump in the 10 frames after it. (That press used to fire as a full ground jump on the first tick at the respawn point and carry Ash back out over the edge.)
room test/spike_chasm
spawn 300 384
frames 120
input
  0..30 R
  31 R jump
  32..57 R
  58 R jump
  59..119 R
end
expect
  at 31 event.air_jump=1
  mark die 30..70 event.hazard=1
  # The jump press on frame 58 is the stale one, and nothing is pressed after the respawn.
  never die+1..die+10 event.jump=1
end
